<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith's Food upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith's Food upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Smith's Food &amp; Drug Centers Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Cited company announcement of a new senior secured credit facility that will pay off existing term debt, revolvers and letter of credit.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-7/8 to 29-7/8.</p>
</text>
